'''Cutpurse Coast''' (こしぎんちゃくの浜辺 ''Koshi Gincha Ku no Hamabe'', '''Cutpurse Beach''') is the 38th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter can and will be difficult. All stages have brutal enemies compositions to heavily push you back. The hardest stage is either [[Procrastinator Parade]] (a group of [[R.Ost]]s supporting one [[Camelle]]) or [[No Return Flights]] ([[Dolphina]]'s first appearance as support for overbuffed [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]], [[Otta-smack-u]]s and a [[Master A.]]), while the easiest is either [[Deep Sea Dying]] (rushable with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]]) or [[Grand Exhibition]] (powercreept by [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]).

Most prior enemies will get a noticeable increase in strength from this sub-chapter onward, which can be seen in [[Swim Meet]] and [[No Return Flights]]. This for many is the hardest sub-chapter in [[Stories of Legend]] as a whole.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Dolphina]]: An incredibly annoying support enemy with the Long Distance ability. Dolphina has high health and attack power, stays at the front lines and gets knocked back up to 30 times, almost like a combination of [[Rain D.]] and [[Mr. Mole]].

