==Trivia==
*''Cutpurse'' is another term for a pickpocket or thief, with reference to cutting the straps that purses originally had at their girdles.
*Dolphina (and possibly this entire sub-chapter) was planned for update 5.10, but for some reason, her entry in the [[Enemy Release Order|Release Order]] was empty.

